=== Workflow Automation Designer ===

# Customer Onboarding Automation Workflow

## 1. OPTIMIZED WORKFLOW DESIGN

### Current State vs. Future State

```
CURRENT STATE (Manual - 5-7 days)
├── Customer submits info via email
├── Manual email verification
├── PDF collection (scattered)
├── Manual data entry (prone to errors)
├── Manager email approval (delays)
└── Manual account setup (multiple systems)

FUTURE STATE (Automated - 2-4 hours)
├── Self-service portal submission
├── Automated email verification
├── Document auto-collection & validation
├── Auto-population & OCR processing
├── Workflow-based approval routing
└── API-driven multi-system provisioning
```

### Detailed Automated Workflow

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ STAGE 1: INITIATION & VERIFICATION (15 min)                 │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│
│ Customer Portal Access
│ ├─ Automated email invitation sent
│ ├─ One-click verification link
│ └─ Session token auto-generated
│
│ Identity Verification (Automated)
│ ├─ Email verification (instant)
│ ├─ Phone SMS verification (optional)
│ └─ Webhook confirmation to CRM
│
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ STAGE 2: DATA COLLECTION (30 min)                           │
├─


